{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114081423806-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114082643\"/><p>事發在屯門順風圍。</p><p>新界北總區警員今日(14日)凌晨1時02分，巡邏至屯門順風圍時，發現一輛私家車懷疑違反交通規例，遂上前截查，期間男司機駕私家車突圍，並撞向一警車後逃去。</p><p>經初步調查，人員發現私家車行車證與車輛登記資料不符。案件列作「行使虛假文書」處理，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:37:03.466311+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T00:14:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T12:58:37.580566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:30:27.580293+00:00","content_hash":"83da5423087c3bd8175f2ac12498559aa759bba20850c4bf6f9ea6ed976791be","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:37:03.466311+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}